  "description": "The proposal is to install new LED luminaires to replace the existing HID floodlights on courts 1-3. The modification will concern only the luminaires at the top of the existing posts, by removing the existing HID fixtures and replacing them with LED fixtures. The posts will remain unmodified, except for the extended mounting brackets at the top to secure the new luminaires. There will be no increase or reduction to the height at which the luminaires sit.",
